    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels so much more permanent than that. i look at the ruins and i don't see any way back. i just see a life that's already over. it's like there's no point in even trying to dig anything out when the world has already moved on without me. why would anyone want to help a ghost rebuild?",
